  // doc: non-negative square root as a floating-point number and int(...) then
  // doc: truncates toward zero; for non-negative inputs truncation equals floor,
  // doc: so int(math.sqrt(n)) = floor(sqrt(n)). For negative n, math.sqrt
  // doc: raises ValueError in CPython; this Dafny routine requires n >= 0.
